<div id="trade-popup" class="trade-popup">
    <div class="trade-popup-content">
        <i id="close-howto" class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
        <h1>How to Trade</h1>
        <h2>Trading with JP Jenkins</h2>
        <strong>Trading Instructions:</strong>
        <p>To buy and sell shares in this company via JP Jenkins, you will need to use a regulated UK stockbroker.</p>
        <p>For a comprehensive list of brokers <a href="/brokers-list">click here.</a></p>
        <p>Over 40 UK brokers regularly connect with our platform. If you are based overseas and are interested in participating then please contact us directly by emailing
            <a href="mailto:"></a>
            or by calling +44 20 7469 0937.
            Trades take place through our central counterparty partner. There is a fee of 1.5% of the transaction price which is charged to both buyers and sellers and a £25 transaction fee. Your broker may also apply charges.
        </p>
        <p>Please note, when purchasing shares Stamp Duty Reserve Tax ("SDRT") may be applicable.</p>
    </div>
</div>
